      "writtenOn": "2026-01-16T19:47:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would have though something like `auto use \u003d Get()-\u003emUniformBuffer-\u003eUseBufferInternal();` is needed here but no tests crashed without it. @lehoangquyen@chromium.org is it expected D3D11 buffer creation never calls MarkUsedInPendingCommands() from ClearInitialResource()?",
      "revId": "8fbbb75bf6a80e75d1491e5377ea2df148fd6f05",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "cea5e8bb_b490834b",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d11/BufferD3D11.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 450,
      "author": {
        "id": 1003501
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-20T16:18:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is probably a bug in the D3D11 backend. It\u0027s mostly working now because the D3D11 runtime would block the `Map` calls until the \"Clear\" commands finish. So even if we don\u0027t mark the buffer as being used, the D3D11 runtime will do that internally for us.",
      "parentUuid": "2d477fae_190f73cb",
      "revId": "8fbbb75bf6a80e75d1491e5377ea2df148fd6f05",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "bc8b209a_835b7fbd",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d11/BufferD3D11.cpp",
        "patchSetId": 18
      },
      "lineNbr": 450,
      "author": {
        "id": 1000002
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-01-20T18:30:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it works because D3D11 commands are buffered internally in the driver so you can\u0027t reorder them, and the clearing happens before all other commands, and mapping will wait for commands to be complete. But it would be good to mark for consistency and to make sure that buffer mapping should return without waits in FinalizeMap.",
      "parentUuid": "2d477fae_190f73cb",
      "revId": "8fbbb75bf6a80e75d1491e5377ea2df148fd6f05",
      "serverId": "dd02978d-1a8e-36d7-bcc0-a5723e5c0abd"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e2fd3c26_f41163cf",
        "filename": "src/dawn/native/d3d12/BufferD3D12.cpp",
